ed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n4.5.beta master\nNot in 4.4.1 stable\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.5.beta (037956dbc) - Windows 11 (build 26100) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - OpenGL 3 (Compatibility) - NVIDIA GeForce RTX 2070 (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.7602) - Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-10750H CPU @ 2.60GHz (12 threads) - 15.82 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nDisabling indent_wrapped_lines still indents the wrapped line, and it can cut off characters:\n\n<img width=\"508\" height=\"156\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/5507e8e5-5e5a-4afd-afe5-99344a8f3317\" />\n\nThis also happens in the inspector text boxes, as it does not use indent_wrapped_lines.\n\nProbably from either https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101824 or https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102514 but I did not check.\n\nAlso, only somewhat related, the `get_rect_at_line_column` and `get_pos_at_line_column` functions do not properly account for the wrap indent.\n\nI am working on a fix.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nWith the script editor:\n1. Disable EditorSetting `text_editor/behavior/indent/indent_wrapped_lines`.\n2. Have a long line of text.\n3. Enable word wrapping.\n\nWith a TextEdit:\n1. Enable line wrapping in a TextEdit (wrap_mode boundary).\n2. Disable indent_wrapped_lines (default).\n3. Use a long line of text, like `\t0123456789012345678901234567890123456789012345678901234567890123456789012345678901234567890123456789012345678901234567890123456789012345678901234567890123456789`.\n\nFor the `get_rect_at_line_column` issue:\n1. Enable `indent_wrapped_lines` and line wrapping.\n2. Print the results of `get_rect_at_line_column` for a position that is indent wrapped. \n3. The x position will be wrong. You can compare it to a position that is not indent wrapped, like on the first wrap. \n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nFor `get_rect_at_line_column`:\n[textedit-get-rect-wrapped-indent-wrong.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/21377679/textedit-get-rect-wrapped-indent-wrong.zip) \nUse the mouse to hover over characters, the reference rect will show the results of `get_rect_at_line_column`.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108888/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108888/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}